> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">40</span> and 50 / 50 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">35</span> and 50 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">35</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: dodgerblue\"><b>Average</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rat God Doll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rat_God_Doll_b1f482.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Leather Harness\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Leather_Harness_8f6344.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ratana\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ratana_5416b7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Life Preserver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Preserver_6136c1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spiky Club\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiky_Club_19b080.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.80<br/>December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Venore Corym Cave</b> is located east of Venore in the swamp, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33073,32085,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33073, 32085, 7)</a>. You have to go up the stairs in the building there and then down the ladders, to prevent roping. The quickest way there is through the <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33002,32096,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">east Venore city entrance (33002, 32096, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>As a paladin of level 55+, skill above 80 and Royal Spears you can make good profit and experience (even 100k/h with stamina bonus) when hunting here with relatively low risk of dying. Just remember not to run like a mindless bot through the caves - just focus on one area filled with as many <a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Vanguard\">Corym Vanguards</a> as possible. Particularly good spot is <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33010,32075,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33010, 32075, 11)</a> (with the large cave north-east, but you will probably not need go there, Coryms respawn is fast).\n</p><p>Level 25+ knights and paladins with decent skill (45+) and plenty of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a> can try to run past the Vanguards to a portal on the bottom floor and access an area filled with <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonerefiner\">Stonerefiners</a>, which give extremely good experience, are weak to physical attacks, and cannot sense invisibility.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Charlatan\"><img alt=\"Corym Charlatan\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corym_Charlatan_5af294.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Charlatan\">Corym Charlatan</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-35× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Rat Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Soft Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bola (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Earflap (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cheese Cutter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Ratana (rare)</li>\n<li>Life Preserver (rare)</li>\n<li>Leather Harness (rare)</li>\n<li>Cheesy Figurine (rare)</li>\n<li>Spike Shield (rare)</li>\n<li>Rat God Doll (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Skirmisher\"><img alt=\"Corym Skirmisher\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corym_Skirmisher_521c17.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Skirmisher\">Corym Skirmisher</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">260</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">450</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">240+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-45× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Rat Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Soft Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cheese Cutter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Earflap (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bola (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Life Preserver (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Ratana (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Cheesy Figurine (rare)</li>\n<li>Spike Shield (rare)</li>\n<li>Leather Harness (rare)</li>\n<li>Rat God Doll (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Vanguard\"><img alt=\"Corym Vanguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corym_Vanguard_b5f822.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Vanguard\">Corym Vanguard</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">490</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">~290+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-90× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bola (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cheese Cutter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Earflap (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Soft Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Rat Cheese (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Spike Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Ratana (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Life Preserver (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Cheesy Figurine (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Leather Harness (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Spiky Club (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Rat God Doll (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Caves\">Corym Caves</a></p></div></div>","quests":["goblin-merchant-quest","grimvale-quest","hidden-threats-quest"]}